  data: {
    LLM: '5 rounds total, all dealing 10 cards. Each round has specific contract for initial meld: Round 1: 2 sets of 3; Round 2: 1 set of 3 + 1 run of 4; Round 3: 2 runs of 4; Round 4: 3 sets of 3; Round 5: 1 run of 3 + 1 run of 7. Turn: Draw (take discard top OR push discard+stock card to left player and take next stock card), meld (must meet contract for first meld), discard. Sets: 3-4 cards same rank (max 4 since 2 decks, no duplicate suits in set). Runs: 3+ same suit sequence, Ace high or low (not both). Wild cards (2s/jokers) substitute any card. Can lay off on any meld after meeting contract. Can replace wild cards with natural cards from hand (wild must be used immediately in new meld). Go out by melding/discarding all cards.',
    Player: '5 rounds total, all dealing 10 cards. Each round has specific contract for initial meld: Round 1: 2 sets of 3; Round 2: 1 set of 3 + 1 run of 4; Round 3: 2 runs of 4; Round 4: 3 sets of 3; Round 5: 1 run of 3 + 1 run of 7. Turn: Draw (take discard top OR push discard+stock card to left player and take next stock card), meld (must meet contract for first meld), discard. Sets: 3-4 cards same rank (max 4 since 2 decks, no duplicate suits in set). Runs: 3+ same suit sequence, Ace high or low (not both). Wild cards (2s/jokers) substitute any card. Can lay off on any meld after meeting contract. Can replace wild cards with natural cards from hand (wild must be used immediately in new meld). Go out by melding/discarding all cards.',
    objective: 'Be the first to go out (play all cards) each round. Lowest cumulative penalty points after 5 rounds wins the pot.',
    gameplay: '5 rounds total, all dealing 10 cards. Each round has specific contract for initial meld: Round 1: 2 sets of 3; Round 2: 1 set of 3 + 1 run of 4; Round 3: 2 runs of 4; Round 4: 3 sets of 3; Round 5: 1 run of 3 + 1 run of 7. Turn: Draw (take discard top OR push discard+stock card to left player and take next stock card), meld (must meet contract for first meld), discard. Sets: 3-4 cards same rank (max 4 since 2 decks, no duplicate suits in set). Runs: 3+ same suit sequence, Ace high or low (not both). Wild cards (2s/jokers) substitute any card. Can lay off on any meld after meeting contract. Can replace wild cards with natural cards from hand (wild must be used immediately in new meld). Go out by melding/discarding all cards.',
